[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; A spilled carton of fries: hand-placeable gull food, at life size. Anything in
; the "gull_food" group attracts gulls, which walk or land beside it, gobble,
; play keepaway with a fry and run off with the child named "carton". Move,
; duplicate or delete instances freely. No collision, so nothing trips on it.

